# "When this creature dies" (CR 700.4): a Sphinx of False Conclusions exiled by Swords to Plowshares never goes to the
# graveyard from the battlefield, so there is no trigger and no copy. Bot1 gains 4 life, the Sphinx is in exile, and its
# controller has no creature (a control is the dies case in the sibling scenarios, where the copy does arrive).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Sphinx of False Conclusions
Forest x4
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Swords to Plowshares
Plains x4
Plains x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Sphinx of False Conclusions.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Sphinx of False Conclusions)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Exile = Sphinx of False Conclusions
Bot1.Life = 24
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire
